config RDMA_TBRXE
	tristate "rxe-derived RDMA engine over the tbframe Thunderbolt frame service"
	depends on INFINIBAND
	select CRC32
	help
	  Soft RDMA provider forked from the rdma_rxe driver with its
	  UDP/IP network transport replaced by the tbframe lossless frame
	  service on Thunderbolt/USB4 XDomain DMA rings. The uverbs ABI and
	  driver id are unchanged, so stock rdma-core librxe remains the
	  userspace provider. See
	  drivers/thunderbolt_ibverbs/docs/tbframe-tbrxe-wire-spec.md.
